[
  {"comment": "Group L: every dialog and window that opens over the main window, shot as a painter opens it, on a document with two layers and a stroke each plus a live selection so the selection-dependent dialogs have something to act on. New Document, Preferences, the brush editor, the brush preset window, the filter browser, two adjustment dialogs, Export, the colour range dialog, the select radius dialog, About, the manual window and the welcome screen. A state dump is taken right after each escape press as well as after its shot, so the dump says whether escape actually closed the window rather than a caption guessing."},
